-- WHOSE reads the first word of each line as a field of the cast (§13.6,
-- RULED 2026-09-21). `rears` is not one of Tenant's, so the checker names the
-- cast and lists the fields it does have, rather than letting the word
-- resolve to whatever else is in scope.
IMPORT prelude

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS tname IS A STRING
               arrears IS A NUMBER
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Pay HAS payer IS AN Actor

alice MEANS Tenant WITH tname IS "Alice", arrears IS 1200
everyone MEANS LIST alice

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`typo in the field name` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t IN everyone
        WHOSE  rears AT LEAST 1000
        MUST   Pay t
        WITHIN 7
        UPON EACH
        HENCE  FULFILLED
        LEST   BREACH
